wayfire (0.11.0-2) stonking; urgency=medium

  * wayfire-dev: add libcairo2-dev, libpango1.0-dev and libgles-dev, without
    which pkg-config --cflags wayfire failed.
  * Split the bundled subprojects into libwf-utils0, libwf-utils-dev and
    libwf-touch-dev, as the archive's wayfire source does.
  * wayfire-dev: depend on those two -dev packages and on libyyjson-dev.
  * libwf-utils0: Conflicts/Replaces libwf-utils0t64.
  * wayfire: Depends on libglx-vendor, matching the archive.

